{
  "name": "u1-rate-sweep",
  "note": "U1 (task kd-CC5yBIzjFt) rate calibration. Full VIS_RATE (mul 20) starved every town by day 3-4 (0/48 both arms, receipt cs-u1-decay-matrix-578022e); the pre-U1 pillar is baseline 0/48 / growth 24/48. This sweeps CIT_DECAY_MUL (twentieths of the tourist rate) via --citdecay to find the value that HOLDS the pillar - growth near 24/48, baseline still 0/48. GROWTH arm (--buy chef,table) at mul {2,3,4,6,8} x seedbase {0,16,32}; BASELINE arm (buy nothing) at the two leading candidates x three blocks, to confirm the lose-by-default floor. mul 0 == the pre-U1 tree by arithmetic (--nodecay), already measured. batch.mjs sets kernel=wasm realm=main.",
  "resources": { "requests": { "cpu": "7", "memory": "2Gi" }, "limits": { "cpu": "8", "memory": "4Gi" } },
  "nodeSelector": { "karpenter.sh/nodepool": "ephemeral-pool" },
